<title>USA: ContiFinancial, N. American Mortgage in alliance.</title>
<headline>ContiFinancial, N. American Mortgage in alliance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>ContiFinancial Corp and North American Mortgage Co said on Tuesday that they agreed to form a strategic alliance.</p>
<p>The pact calls for ContiFinancial to have access to North American Mortgage's nationwide, mortgage-loan origination channels and give North American access to ContiFinancial's underwriting and servicing of subprime mortgage loans.</p>
</text>
